WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.170
Delzaine!

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.710
Emilio...

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.440
I've finally come for you.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.050
This is where I'll end it!

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:46.970
<i>In the city without love</i> <i>only your smile remains.</i>

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:56.980
<i>Hold me tight to crush the loneliness,</i> <i>it's all that stops these pains.</i>

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:07.400
<i>You're constrained by that limit.</i>
<i>Free yourself and break apart the chains.</i>

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:17.400
<i>It's all gonna burn on down.</i>
<i>Dance to the flames that consume the night.</i>

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:27.570
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright.</i>

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:38.090
<i>Dance to the end of the night.</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:48.090
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright. Dance!</i>

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:58.770
<i>In the city without love</i>

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:19.230
You must be pretty careless to let me betray you.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.900
But now...

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.140
It's already too late for you!

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.240
You've grown strong...

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:37.690
Shut up!

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.520
Get out your weapon, Delzaine!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.990
You're not even going to put up a fight?!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:49.600
What do you plan to do after you kill me?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.270
After all, I'm the king of Endora.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:56.400
When Endora is without a king, what will you do then?

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.010
I said it before, Emilio...

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:05.040
You've come to take the throne for yourself.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:17.030
"12: The Light of Babel"

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.270
That will take me right down to Babel...

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:34.270
Louise! I'll leave these chumps to you!

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.450
Mischa! Felix! Chase after him!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:44.250
But...

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.890
I'll be fine!

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.960
Just go!

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.390
Please, go!

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.460
All right.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.900
Let's move.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.670
Was it wise to let them go?

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.140
You'll soon regret it!

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.240
Why did you let me live?!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.680
You knew I'd betray you!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.270
Why didn't you kill me then?!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.620
Don't help!

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:29.130
Come at me with all you've got!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.300
You'll be dead if you don't!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.700
Demetrio!

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.180
Listen to me, Louise...

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:50.020
I heard why you joined up with the Truculent.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:55.960
It was to help your Zoozian father and his wife live in peace.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.560
You needed money to make that happen.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.830
But...

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.300
What about you, yourself?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.320
Are you content as it is?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:10.710
Was this entire time you spent with the Ignauts just an act?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:15.540
Even the time you saved me from
Gradido and the Zoozians on the island?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.210
Was that all just a lie?

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:27.220
You know it's not, Louise.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.030
Tell me the truth, Louise.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:43.910
I told you! It was all an act to gain your trust!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:44.840
Louise!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.010
Of course I never meant any of it!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.850
You just fell for it like the fool you are!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.080
Louise!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.120
I'm done talking. You both are as good as dead.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.090
You best be ready, Demetrio.
I'm starting with you!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.190
Die!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.740
You're already dead inside.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.710
The real you is gone.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.150
You've killed your heart to come this far.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.580
Am I wrong?

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:36.390
There must be a way to live without killing your heart.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.560
Let us find it together, Louise.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.230
It's... been so painful.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:48.170
The Truculent are the king's dogs who do all his dirty work.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:53.080
As long as they get paid, they'll do anything he asks without question.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:57.250
When I was told to follow the Ignauts and keep track of your movements...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.910
...it was supposed to go like any other job for me.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:08.320
At first I scoffed at your idea of a bloodless revolution.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:14.160
I thought it was the naïve dream of some spoiled noble brat.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.370
But I was wrong...

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:21.200
If your ambitions were to somehow come true...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:24.110
If someday it became possible...

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.870
Someday, I thought...

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.040
I began to believe your dream, too.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.310
But then...

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.480
When the prince and the others suddenly showed up,

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:37.210
I was brought back to the cruel reality.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:42.650
My place wasn't with the Ignauts, but the Truculent.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.330
Yes...

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.160
It's just like you said.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:53.070
I spent my days lying to myself and regretted every minute of it.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.800
I... I...

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:05.350
You've said enough, Louise.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:06.750
Louise...

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.180
Eljuia...

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.760
Thank you.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.870
I... tried to kill you.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:27.940
When you aimed your sword at me,
I saw the color of your heart.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.370
It was as clear as could be.

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:32.860
I knew you wouldn't harm me.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.340
I'm so sorry...

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.710
Hey now. We don't have time to be crying.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.450
Let's get ourselves to Babel.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.970
I'll create an opening.
You sneak around behind him.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.310
Don't order me around.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:08.080
You guys fine with this?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.940
With what?

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.910
Fighting here with me.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:12.310
What do you mean?

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:18.250
By now, Louise is probably cutting your precious leader into pieces.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.580
I've wasted enough time playing around with you.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.740
It's about time I go on my way.

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.340
Catch you later!

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.350
Dammit.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:51.650
Felix!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.750
Demetrio! You're all--

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:56.590
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.260
Mischa, don't.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:03.700
We're all squared up now.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.440
He got away from us.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.700
That's okay. We all know where he's headed.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:20.820
You know, seeing all your great inventions really gives me pleasure.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:27.190
It really means a lot to me to be praised by the great Pascal, my lifelong idol!

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:31.190
Well, it's not so much as praise, per se...

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.730
But seeing you reminds me of a younger version of myself.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.400
Meaning what, exactly?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:41.200
There was once a time I made something just like this.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.340
You're saying your genius and mine had the same vision?

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.710
I'm incredibly honored!

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:48.540
And I'm glad as well!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:55.320
You steal everything precious away from me!

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:57.650
Precious?

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:01.720
You stole my father's life and forced Pascal away from me!

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.600
Stole, you say?

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.270
That's why...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.770
...now, I'll steal your life away from you!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.200
Emilio!

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:20.740
Emilio.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.280
Emilio...

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.710
Shun.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.630
Huh?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.770
Dying...

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:56.110
Wow, you really got it handed to you.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.210
You all right?

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.610
Negative.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:03.750
Babel... The link between here and the surface.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:08.290
I wonder what the surface is like?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.720
Don't you?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.790
Rescue!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.160
Is that right? So you wanna go there, too?

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:21.930
Problem is, you guys would just hold me back.

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.640
Nice knowing you.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.450
Ibelda?! What was that for?

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.850
What the--

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.320
Beopetle? Vestulse!

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:46.930
Ibelda... Don't tell me you did this?

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:50.630
You think I killed my comrades, Guidoro?

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:54.270
That the Truculent were all partners working together?

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:58.040
Did you think that bond meant anything to me?

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.140
Do you, Guidoro?

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:03.450
Do you even know what you've done, Ibelda?!

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.310
Of course I do!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:10.120
When Delzaine goes to the surface, we'll be left to fend for ourselves.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:13.380
It'll be right back to our old lifestyle.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:18.830
You know what? I've had enough of that.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.300
So don't even try to get in my way!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.350
It's working!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.730
What? Could it be?!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.100
Babel! It's operational!

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.840
It appears to have started.

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.240
This is bad...

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.910
Emilio!

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.210
Stop it, Emilio!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.720
Stay out of this, Shun!

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.520
My lord! The gate will soon open!

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:18.850
Mm-hmm.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.390
Delzaine!

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:22.360
You running away to the surface?!

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:27.060
I won't allow it! I'm not finished with you!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.590
I pushed myself to live for this day!

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:47.110
It can't be...

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.110
No... It's not possible!

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.720
I'll end this now!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.490
My lord! Babel has opened!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:58.930
Please hurry!

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.800
Delzaine!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:13.300
There is still something I have yet to do.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:17.980
Delzaine!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.780
Emilio, enough!

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.950
Shun! Don't get in my way!

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:22.920
I'm not!

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:24.150
What?!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:26.420
I've come to stop you.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.020
Huh?

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.650
I told you I won't let you have your revenge!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.790
Hey! Isn't he your son?

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:41.300
That's right. He is my son.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:46.210
Then why did you kill his father?!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.840
Explain yourself already!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.110
Was it really just to take the throne?

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.810
Tell us the whole story!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.970
So this is where you're all hiding!

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:14.200
Emilio!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.070
Enough, Ibelda! Stand down!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:19.140
Hmph! I don't think so, my lord.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.540
What was that?!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:25.340
If I don't end things with him,
I'll never find peace.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.210
Prepare to die!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.750
You're in the way, my lord!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:47.060
Father!

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:59.210
The king! Delzaine was killed?!

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:07.280
So this is the way to the surface, eh?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.090
What's the matter, Prince?

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.360
Miss your father already?

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:15.130
Shut up!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.690
Emilio, watch out!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:24.970
I hate leaving with you still alive, but oh well.

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.610
I'm off to the surface.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:27.780
What?!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.210
Farewell!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.880
Wait! You're not going anywhere!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.320
Are you serious?

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.750
Father!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.020
Emilio...

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.160
Emilio.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.700
What in the world happened?

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:32.370
It can't be...

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.040
Emilio!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.380
My lord!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:40.320
Babel worked as planned?

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:43.990
I won't know for sure without some research, but...

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:47.390
...there was something
I needed to ask Lord Delzaine.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:52.060
I fear I may have come too late.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:55.500
You've become strong, Emilio.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.750
Father...

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:08.940
We talk of a place called Hades in the underworld.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:13.980
Deep inside, there's a terrible place known as Hell.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:18.250
It's supposedly overrun by evil demons and monsters.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:25.320
But I've always wondered what
Hades and Hell were actually like.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:31.280
No... I've always wondered if there was even an underworld to begin with.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:38.590
Now I live in this world underground called Endora.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:44.610
It's quite different from how
I imagined the underworld would be.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.010
Much different...

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.930
"To be continued..."

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:09.630
<i>Took a long way to get here</i>

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:13.600
<i>Had to go around and around</i>

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:17.710
<i>But every single road I've taken</i>

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:21.610
<i>Made me who I am today</i>

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:28.540
<i>go my way go my way</i>

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:40.030
<i>The world will show you there's tomorrow</i>

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:48.560
<i>Look up to the blue sky and you will see</i>

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:57.480
<i>I try to be better than who I was yesterday</i>

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:04.650
<i>So I can see you with a smile on my face today</i>

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:09.890
<i>Now what should we get into today?</i>

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:18.530
<i>The scent of summer arouses my heart</i>

00:22:18.530 --> 00:22:23.670
<i>And I can't seem to find the right words to tell you</i>

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:28.110
<i>That I love you just the way you are</i>

00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:39.950
"Episode 13: Tracks"

00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:39.720
Next episode, "Tracks."
